  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5703.11 Authorization for Release of Criminal Conviction Record.\n\n(a) The following shall be provided by the person authorizing release of his or her criminal conviction record:\n\n(1) Name, including any alias, and address;\n\n(2) Date of birth;\n\n(3) Driver license number and state, if licensed;\n\n(4) Eye, hair color, and sex;\n\n(5) Use for the record;\n\n(6) Name of person or agency authorized to receive record;\n\n(7) Address of person or agency authorized to receive record;\n\n(8) Signature and date signed by person authorizing release of his or her criminal conviction record; and\n\n(9) Signature and seal of a notary public or signature of a justice of the peace and date.\n\n(b) The requestor shall provide the following:\n\n(1) Signature and printed name of requestor or person acting on behalf of agency; and\n\n(2) Date.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5700) #6704, eff 3-3-98; amd by #8173, eff 9-21-04; amd by #8591, INTERIM, eff 3-24-06, EXPIRES: 9-20-06; ss by #8651, eff 6-2-06, EXPIRED: 6-2-14\n\nNew. #11157, INTERIM, eff 8-18-16, EXPIRED: 2-14-17\n\nNew. #12132, eff 3-17-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5700.html"
